{"id":"n37070-1-11","stage":1,"title":"그립다 · 思念","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37070-1-11-1","ko":"요즘 왜 그렇게 표정이 안 좋니?","zh":"最近怎么心情这么不好啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"표정이","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋니?","meaning":"那样就好了","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"fb140081bcc182e5","term":"표정","zh":"表情，脸色","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3","entryId":"72390","definition":"心中的情感或想法等表露在脸上；或指那样的模样。","pronunciation":["표정"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1fc0926701d55bba1f9a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37070-1-11-2","ko":"고향이 그리워서 그래.","zh":"因为想家了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고향이","meaning":"故乡，家园","explanation":"고향：故乡，家园；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"2","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그리워서","meaning":"思念，怀念","explanation":"그립다：思念，怀念；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"그립다","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37070","senseId":"1","lemma":"그립다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样，一般","explanation":"그렇다：那样，一般；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"5","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家园","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"难以忘怀、眷恋的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"b0dcbd20216264fb","term":"그립다","zh":"思念，怀念","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3","entryId":"37070","definition":"非常想念，想见面。","pronunciation":["그립따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，一般","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","def